8h40bHiaibPpT4DtlOg6bp1ug79vU75XdCXFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibRInXqk56yg9morOPFrFXjm1C7SGqwj1toYJYIZTJ8h40bHiaibPpT4DtlOg6bp1ug79vU75XdCXFQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcibRInXqk56yg9morOPFrFXjMKQz4YVCSlSbhKJhHsP6SoQJW9voOoPjGztmZa8Pic6tf8HibRJRQSgg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招聘岗位</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 植物保护学院院长</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院概况：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://zb.scau.edu.cn/xygk/list.htm</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 兽医学院院长</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院概况：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://vet.scau.edu.cn/xygk/list.psp</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. 海洋学院院长</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>学院概况：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://hy.scau.edu.cn/5399/list.htm</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>应聘条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1.  政治素质过硬，遵守国家法律法规。热爱高等教育事业，具有强烈的事业心，品行端正、治学严谨。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.  学术造诣深厚，在相关研究领域取得国内外同行公认的学术成就，具有良好的学术声誉，总体达到国家级人才水平。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.  熟悉高等教育和科研组织规律，有学术、教育机构的管理工作经历和实绩，有较强的组织管理能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.  年龄不超过55周岁，条件特别优秀的可适当放宽。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>岗位职责</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>主持学院行政全面工作，谋划和制定学院发展总体目标和战略规划，推进和保障各项改革发展任务的执行落实，完成聘任合同约定的其它工作任务。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>聘期与待遇</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>聘期一般为四年。学校将提供有竞争力的薪酬待遇及支持条件。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>5</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招聘程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 本次招聘采用</span></span><strong><span><span>个人报名和专家推荐</span></span></strong><span><span>两种方式进行，欢迎校内外专家、校友推荐。报名通过电子邮件、信件方式提交报名表和相关材料。报名或推荐的截止时间为</span></span><strong><span><span>2025年8月31日</span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 学校组织专家进行审核，择优邀请候选人进行面谈。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. 根据面谈情况，学校按照相关程序确定聘任人选，双方签订聘任合同。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>6</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>应聘者需提供的材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>1. 填写《华南农业大学公开招聘院长报名表》（扫描二维码下载）</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlcibRInXqk56yg9morOPFrFXjjZVPic549icSLazlxUqdDtfeaV2lv11Mx5Cpj8kXga0NJefjZtz1ypdw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></s